Description:

An Authorization header consisting of an authentication scheme and trailing
whitespace, with no credentials at all, no longer reads past the end of its
buffer.  Previously the whitespace-skipping loop ran off the end of the string
and the adjacent heap was then treated as the client's credentials.

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-9hvv-75vm-ffrj.


